p.src:
For the harmonic oscillator, the occupation-number states may be written either as kets $\lvert n\rangle$ or as bras $\langle n\rvert$. Their inner product is $\langle m\vert n\rangle=\delta_{mn}
=\begin{cases}
1,&m=n,\\
0,&m\neq n.
\end{cases}$ The Kronecker delta $\delta_{mn}$ is the discrete analogue of the Dirac delta function.

